      "en": "The altar was also split apart, and the ashes poured out from the altar, according to the sign which the man of God had given by the LORD’s word.",
      "ko": "하나님의 사람의 여호와의 말씀으로 보인 예조대로 단이 갈라지며 재가 단에서 쏟아진지라",
      "source_text_hash": "82da01c8582e8f7d7b5116ccd5871fd32c639bbde5fe9bf761d960283ac811a8",
      "translation_text_hash": "7f155c136f346d2e9253b84c4dd67080eb212a29e03e10d97aa582a52e710982",
